orned carp with bitter nectar is served here."},{"id":"marker6","name":"The Huge Jaguar","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious cured badger with dark sap is served here."},{"id":"marker7","name":"The Favorable Bear","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious dressed olives with fire whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker8","name":"The Old Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious marinated melon with red sap is served here."},{"id":"marker9","name":"The Friendly Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious pan-fried carrot with sour gin is served here."},{"id":"marker10","name":"Shifnal Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker11","name":"Bromerford Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker12","name":"Padstedan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Warescom Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker14","name":"Maltontef Waterfall","legend":"A river drops down from a great height forming a wonderous waterfall."},{"id":"marker15","name":"Hertfieldbu Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Sabingian War. \r\nDate: January 31, 985 Louth Era."},{"id":"marker16","name":"Berford Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Burnetersian Campaign. \r\nDate: April 11, 966 Louth Era."},{"id":"marker17","name":"Apton Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Berfordian Rebellion. \r\nDate: November 7, 963 Louth Era."},{"id":"marker18","name":"Godford Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Kinglian War. \r\nDate: August 12, 983 Louth Era."},{"id":"marker19","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3831705936\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"poin