 monster of 19 ft long inhabits Uxbriden Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Harham Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 28 ft long."},{"id":"marker27","name":"Lympswest Roc","legend":"Tipplers speak of a great Roc who inhabits Lympswest hills and prefers eating children."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Thatcheap Mountain","legend":"A sacred mountain of No religion. Height: 9567 ft."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Mantonley Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Helster Deities."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Witfordge Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Dodbrid Spirits."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Ormsmouthbu Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Old Hinck Faith."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Heyteskirk Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Helster Deities."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Winerington Crows","legend":"A gang of swamp bandits."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Manchton Foxes","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Wodley Leopards","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker36","name":"Paigndover Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker37","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker38","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker39","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker40","name":"Netown Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༰༓༣༱༶༰༤༰༿༢༯་༿༱༭༹༷༚༖༸༙༥༓༂༲༼༥༼༜༁༮༆༲༈༭༗༈༒༇༁༲༵༫༄༺༧༒༅༊༡༕༾༽༫༱༉༳༫༭༻༆༕</div>"},{"id":"marker41","name":"Osfield Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሐከፀገተሠ የወገበጠሰአየተሐኀተጰነተዐሠ ፀወኀወኀአጠጰኀጸከደዐሐወገፈወለበዘኀሰሐ</div>"},{"id":"marker42","name":"Wihulbone Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐጸፈበሀሠፐጸበኀተተነ ወፈጰረየሐ ዐ ገጠጠሰነበጸደደጠ ጠፐሠፈኀኀወደጸአሠሰፀበሀ</div>"},{"id":"marker43","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker46","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker47","name":"Quatford Collection","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker48","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker49","name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker50","name":"Cudlehore Joust","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a joust of the greats in Cudlehore, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker51","name":"Bucham Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Bucham, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Wistonden River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Hyenas migration","legend":"A huge group of hyenas are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Illusory mirage","legend":"This illusory mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Seabingin Grotto","legend":"The Seabingin Grotto. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Kirbury Necropolis","legend":"An eerie necropolis where nature intertwines with death. Overgrown tombstones are entwined by thorny vines, and mournful spirits wander among the fading petals of once-vibrant flowers."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/5260\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker58","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/769\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker59","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3660\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker60","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4943\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker61","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1332\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker62","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4692\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker63","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1334\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"}]
